  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner capacity strengthening on child protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the fourth and final child protection taskforce workshop hosted by Caritas Australia in Phnom Penh. The workshop brings partner staff members as CP focal points to share current initiatives, challenges of CP mainstreaming in their work, examine strategies for the continuation of CP initiatives, and to discuss strategies for sustainability of CP in organisation and communities.

At the end of the workshop, the focal points developed action plans to mainstream CP into their work. Evaluation and actions plans from were documented and linked in Supporting Documents.</narrative>
  </description>
